 الْبُرْهَانُ / السُّلْطَانُ / الْمِيزَانُ","Haq-o-baatil ka farq / Roshan daleel / Ghalba / Tarazoo"],["Imtihan wa Anjaam","الْغُرُورُ / الْخُسْرَانُ / النَّدَامَةُ / الْعَاقِبَةُ","Dhoka / Khasaara / Sharmindagi / Aakhri anjaam"]]}},{"id":"sec_s1l8_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 1 • LESSON 8</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Buniyadi Qur'ani Alfaaz (Set 8 — Mukammal Buniyadi Zakheera) (Page 28–29)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْغُرُورُ ، التَّسْبِيحُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Qur'ani Alfaaz (Set 8)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْغُرُورُ ، التَّسْبِيحُ ، التَّصْدِيقُ ، الْفُرْقَانُ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الْغُرُورُ ، التَّسْبِيحُ (Dhoka, Tasbeeh) → الْغُرُورُ ، التَّسْبِيحُ ، التَّصْدِيقُ ، الْفُرْقَانُ (Dhoka, Paaki bayaan karna, Sach maanna, Furqan).</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Unit 1 mein aasaan Qur'ani alfaaz aur buniyadi ishaare/qawa'id sikhaye gaye hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 28–29):** Pehle 8 asbaaq mein aapne 288 buniyadi Qur'ani alfaaz seekh liye hain jo Qur'an Majeed ke har safhe par baar-baar aate hain."}},{"id":"sec_s1l8_lbl0","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Basic Easy Qur'anic Vocabulary — Bunyadi Aasan Qur'ani Alfaaz"}},{"id":"sec_s1l8_r1","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Yeh bunyadi alfaaz aam taur par aap pehchante honge. Nisbatan naye alfaaz ke maani de diye gaye hain."}},{"id":"sec_s1l8_g2","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s1l8_g2_w1","arabic":"الْغُرُور","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْغُرُور</span>","hinglish":"Dhoka / Fareb","translations":{"en":"Delusion / Deception","ur":"دھوکہ / فریب","hi":"धोखा / फ़रेब"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w2","arabic":"الْبَشَر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَشَر</span>","hinglish":"Insaan / Bashar","translations":{"en":"Human being / Mankind","ur":"انسان / بشر","hi":"इंसान / बशर"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w3","arabic":"الْغَضَب","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْغَضَب</span>","hinglish":"Gussa / Ghazab","translations":{"en":"Anger / Wrath","ur":"غصہ / غضب","hi":"गुस्सा / ग़ज़ब"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w4","arabic":"الْمِثَال","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمِثَال</span>","hinglish":"Misaal / Namoona","translations":{"en":"Exampl