,"hinglish":"Aag","translations":{"en":"The Fire","ur":"آگ","hi":"आग"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w23","arabic":"الْفِسْق","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْفِسْق</span>","hinglish":"Naafarmani / Gunaah / Fisq","translations":{"en":"Disobedience / Defiance / Transgression","ur":"نافرمانی / گناہ / فسق","hi":"नाफ़रमानी / गुनाह / फ़िसक़"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w24","arabic":"الْبَيَان","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَيَان</span>","hinglish":"Bayaan / Saaf wazaahat","translations":{"en":"Clear declaration / Speech","ur":"بیان / صاف وضاحت","hi":"बयान / साफ़ वज़ाहत"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w25","arabic":"السَّلَام","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّلَام</span>","hinglish":"Salamati / Amn","translations":{"en":"Peace / Safety","ur":"سلامتی / امن","hi":"सलामती / अम्न"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w26","arabic":"الْقَوْل","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقَوْل</span>","hinglish":"Baat / Qawl","translations":{"en":"Word / Statement / Speech","ur":"بات / قول","hi":"बात / क़ौल"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w27","arabic":"الْكُرْسِيّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكُرْسِيّ</span>","hinglish":"Kursi","translations":{"en":"Throne / Footstool / Seat","ur":"کرسی","hi":"कुर्सी"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w28","arabic":"الْكَامِل","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكَامِل</span>","hinglish":"Kaamil / Poora","translations":{"en":"Complete / Perfect / Full","ur":"کامل / پورا","hi":"कामिल / पूरा"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w29","arabic":"النِّصْف","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">النِّصْف</span>","hinglish":"Aadha / Nisf","translations":{"en":"Half","ur":"آدھا / نصف","hi":"आधा / निस्फ़"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w30","arabic":"الْقِيَام","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقِيَام</span>","hinglish":"Khada hona / Qiyaam","translations":{"en":"Standing / Standing upright","ur":"کھڑا ہونا / قیام","hi":"खड़ा होना / क़ियाम"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w31","arabic":"الْوَقْت","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْوَقْت</span>","hinglish":"Waqt","translations":{"en":"Time / Appointed time","ur":"وقت","hi":"वक़्त"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w32","arabic":"الْمَظْلُوم","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَظْلُوم</span>","hinglish":"Mazloom / Jis par zulm hua","translations":{"en":"The oppressed / Wronged","ur":"مظلوم / جس پر ظلم ہوا","hi":"मज़लूम / जिस पर ज़ुल्म हुआ"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w33","arabic":"الشَّمْسُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">الشَّمْسُ</span>","hinglish":"Sooraj","translations":{"en":"The Sun","ur":"سورج","hi":"सूरज"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w34","arabic":"الْإِلٰه","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِلٰه</span>","hinglish":"Mabood / Ilaah / Poojne ke laaiq","translations":{"en":"Deity / God / Worthy of worship","ur":"معبود / الٰہ / پوجنے کے لائق","hi":"माबूद / इलाह / पूजने के लायक़"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w35","arabic":"الشَّدِيد","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشَّدِيد</span>","hinglish":"Sakht / Zabardast","translations":{"en":"Severe / Stern / Intense","ur":"سخت / زبردست","hi":"सख़्त / ज़बरदस्त"}},{"id":"s1l8_g2_w36","arabic":"التَّصْدِيق","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">التَّصْدِيق</span>","hinglish":"Tasdeeq karna / Sach maanna","translations":{"en":"Confirmation / Verifying as truth","ur":"تصدیق کرنا / سچ ماننا","hi":"तस्दीक़ करना / सच मानना"}}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s1l8_r3","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Yeh kitaab iss andaaz mein tayyar ki gayi hai ke In Sha' Allah aahista aahista aap Al-Hamd (اَلْحَمْد) se An-Naas (وَالنَّاس) tak poora Quran samajhne ke qabil ho jayenge!","hinglish_text":"Yeh kitaab iss andaaz mein tayyar ki gayi hai ke mein Sha' Allah aahista aahista aap Al-Hamd (اَلْحَمْد) se ek-Naas (وَالنَّاس) tak poora Quran samajhne ke qabil ho jayenge!"}},{"id":"sec_s1l8_r4","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Alfaaz jaise (الشَّمْسُ, النَّارُ, السَّمَاءُ, الْأَرْضُ, جَهَنَّمُ) ke aakhir mein [ة] nahi hai, lekin Ahle Arab inhein Mu'annath (feminine) maante hain."}},{"id":"sec_s1l8_lbl5","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Exercise — Qur'anic Aayaat"}},{"id":"sec_s1l8_r6","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Darj zail Quranic aayaton mein se un alfaaz par ghaur karein jinhe aap mukammal taur par samajhte hain:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l8_v7","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s1l8_v7_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"فَخَرَجَ عَلَىٰ قَوْمِهِ مِنَ الْمِحْرَابِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَخَرَجَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمِهِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">مِحْرَابِ</span>","hinglish":"Toh woh apni qaum ke saamne mihrab se baahar aaye.","translations":{"ur":"تو وہ اپنی قوم کے سامنے محراب سے باہر آئے","en":"So he came out to his people from the prayer chamber","hi":"तो वे अपनी क़ौम के सामने मेहराब से बाहर आए"},"ref":"19:11"},{"id":"s1l8_v7_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"مِنَ الْبَشَرِ أَحَدًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">بَشَرِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَحَدًا</span>","hinglish":"Insaanon mein se kisi ek ko.","translations":{"ur":"انسانوں میں سے کسی ایک کو","en":"Anyone among human beings","hi":"इंसानों में से किसी एक को"},"ref":"19:26"},{"id":"s1l8_v7_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"وَعَلَيْهِمْ غَضَبٌ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ شَدِيدٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَعَلَيْهِمْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">غَضَبٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَل</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َهُمْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَذَابٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَدِيدٌ</span>","hinglish":"Aur un par ghazab hai aur unke liye sakht azaab hai.","translations":{"en":"And upon them is wrath, and for them is a severe punishment","ur":"اور ان پر غضب ہے اور ان کے لیے سخت عذاب ہے","hi":"और उन पर ग़ज़ब है और उनके लिए सख्त अज़ाब है"},"ref":"42:16"},{"id":"s1l8_v7_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"ذٰلِكُمْ فِسْقٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">ذٰل</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ِكُمْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِسْقٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh naafarmani aur gunaah hai.","translations":{"ur":"یہ نافرمانی اور گناہ ہے","en":"That is grave disobedience","hi":"यह नाफ़रमानी और गुनाह है"},"ref":"5:3"},{"id":"s1l8_v7_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"مَا لَا يَرْضَىٰ مِنَ الْقَوْلِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَرْضَىٰ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْلِ</span>","hinglish":"Baat mein se aisi baat jo na-pasand ho.","translations":{"ur":"بات میں سے ایسی بات جو ناپسند ہو","en":"Speech which He does not approve","hi":"बात में से ऐसी बात जो नापसंद हो"},"ref":"4:108"},{"id":"s1l8_v7_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"اسْتَقَامُوا عَلَى الطَّرِيقَةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">اسْتَقَام</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُوا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الطَّرِيقَةِ</span>","hinglish":"Woh seedhe raaste par qaaim rahe.","translations":{"ur":"وہ سیدھے راستے پر قائم رہے","en":"They remained straight on the way","hi":"वे सीधे रास्ते पर क़ायम रहे"},"ref":"72:16"},{"id":"s1l8_v7_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"أَنَّ الْقُوَّةَ لِلَّهِ جَمِيعًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">أَنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">قُوَّةَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">لَّهِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جَمِيعًا</span>","hinglish":"Tamaam taaqat Allah hi ke liye hai.","translations":{"ur":"تمام طاقت اللہ ہی کے لیے ہے","en":"That all power belongs to Allah","hi":"तमाम ताक़त अल्लाह ही के लिए है"},"ref":"2:165"},{"id":"s1l8_v7_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"فَجَزَاؤُهُ جَهَنَّمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَجَزَاؤُهُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جَهَنَّمُ</span>","hinglish":"Toh uska badla jahannam hai.","translations":{"ur":"تو اس کا بدلہ جہنم ہے","en":"Then his recompense is Hell","hi":"तो उसका बदला जहन्नम है"},"ref":"4:93"},{"id":"s1l8_v7_s9","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"إِذْ هُمَا فِي الْغَارِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِذْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">هُمَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">غَارِ</span>","hinglish":"Jab woh dono ghaar mein thay.","translations":{"ur":"جب وہ دونوں غار میں تھے","en":"When they were in the cave","hi":"जब वे दोनों ग़ार में थे"},"ref":"9:40"},{"id":"s1l8_v7_s10","sentence_number":10,"arabic":"ثَلَاثَ مَرَّاتٍ مِّن قَبْلِ صَلَاةِ الْفَجْرِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">ثَلَاثَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَرّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َاتٍ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مِّن</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَبْلِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">صَلَاةِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">فَجْرِ</span>","hinglish":"Fajr ki namaz se pehle teen martaba.","translations":{"ur":"فجر کی نماز سے پہلے تین مرتبہ","en":"Three times — before the dawn prayer","hi":"फ़ज्र की नमाज़ से पहले तीन मर्तबा"},"ref":"24:58"},{"id":"s1l8_v7_s11","sentence_number":11,"arabic":"جِئْنَاكَ بِالْحَقِّ وَأَحْسَنَ تَفْسِيرًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">جِئْنَاكَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بِالْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">حَقِّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأَحْسَنَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تَفْسِيرًا</span>","hinglish":"Hum aapke paas haq aur behtareen wazaahat ke saath aaye.","translations":{"ur":"ہم آپ کے پاس حق اور بہترین وضاحت کے ساتھ آئے","en":"We have brought you the truth and the best explanation","hi":"हम आपके पास हक़ और बेहतरीन वज़ाहत के साथ आए"},"ref":"25:33"},{"id":"s1l8_v7_s12","sentence_number":12,"arabic":"لِكَيْلَا يَكُونَ عَلَيْكَ حَرَجٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">كَيْلَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَك</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُونَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَيْكَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَرَجٌ</span>","hinglish":"Taaki aap par koi tangi na ho.","translations":{"ur":"تاکہ آپ پر کوئی تنگی نہ ہو","en":"So that there will not be upon you any discomfort","hi":"ताकि आप पर कोई तंगी न हो"},"ref":"33:50"}],"cols":3}}]}}